  m_Name: Banker Sterling
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.TrueEncounterData
  vendorName: Banker Sterling
  offerText: I represent an anonymous trust that wishes to use your personal accounts
    to park a rather staggering sum of capital. We just need you to hold it for a
    few hours.
  acceptResultText: Your bank account balance balloons to a number you have never
    seen before. You feel like an absolute titan of industry!
  rejectResultText: Sterling adjusts his silk tie and walks away. You spend the next
    hour anxiously checking your meager, pathetic bank balance.
  acceptedDelayedText: Federal agents freeze all your accounts due to offshore money
    laundering. You are left entirely penniless and terrified of going to prison.
  rejectedDelayedText: You saw Sterling is captured by federal agents and you're
    glad you did not help him.
  accepted: 1
  rejectedEffects:
